{"about":["Lost Judgment is an action-adventure game that blends detective work, narrative-driven exploration, and dynamic combat. Players take on the role of a private detective investigating cases across urban environments, gathering evidence, tailing suspects, and uncovering hidden connections while engaging in fast-paced fighting encounters.","The game expands on its predecessor with new investigative mechanics, varied side activities, and multiple combat styles that emphasize fluid movement and adaptability. Its structure combines story-focused progression with open-ended exploration, offering a mix of mystery-solving and action."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/cT6UQkXLAnJtmdk21aIy4B3D.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/cT6UQkXLAnJtmdk21aIy4B3D.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/qOdiK9BZNqGj9fICIsDn1ePB.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/qOdiK9BZNqGj9fICIsDn1ePB.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/ECAeclsxAI4ONS9MUqTV650g.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/ECAeclsxAI4ONS9MUqTV650g.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/obRFw84SIcWscKG1a8jmB8P6.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/obRFw84SIcWscKG1a8jmB8P6.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/ovQNOYlx4PxC9YMGcS6HZb3N.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/ovQNOYlx4PxC9YMGcS6HZb3N.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202105/0603/CzqWKUsQYUNZFUmuapEhHG3d.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/r